OL,3,GNEWSAFree buses for school children in
OL,4,Atemporary housing
OL,5,
OL,6,FChildren living in temporary housing in
OL,7,FGreater Manchester will get free bus
OL,8,Ftravel to and from school on the city
OL,9,Fregion's Bee Network from 1 September,
OL,10,Fmayor Bev Craig has announced.
OL,12,FThe move is part of The Greater
OL,13,FManchester Strategy, a plan for the
OL,14,Fregion's next decade which is focused
OL,15,Fon reducing the number of families and
OL,16,Fchildren in temporary accommodation.
OL,18,FIt means children placed in temporary
OL,19,Faccommodation can always get to their
OL,20,Fschool, maintaining their routine and
OL,21,Fminimising disruption to their
OL,22,Feducation.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
