OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFree buses for school children in
OL,4,Atemporary housing
OL,5,
OL,6,FFamilies who are eligible, which
OL,7,Fincludes those living more than two
OL,8,Fmiles from their school or where their
OL,9,Froute is considered unsafe to walk,
OL,10,Fwill be assessed for inclusion by their
OL,11,Flocal council, which will then issue a
OL,12,Fpass.
